      "effect": "The cyan/blue collar ribs stand out as repeated supports framing darker flat centers. Together with the plain cyan crown, they keep the overall finish reading as panel construction and weaken the intended continuous softly lit cartoon stone appearance, despite the improved native stone masses.",
      "desiredVisibleOutcome": "Keep the new large beveled stone construction and readable blue base. Integrate the crown and collar light/material response with the adjacent stone planes so repeated modules read as one coherent stone wall, with controlled broad soft highlights, cobalt midtones and sparse deeper recesses instead of conspicuous bright ribs/plain cyan fields. Preserve opaque clean caps, exact full.08 finite collars, matching normalized field/albedo/material under all4 rotations and the frozen capture. A revised matching canonical field is allowed; no old round01 field, literal shader graph, specific part count, added decoration or target-pixel copy is required."
    }
